  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHC School of Tolerance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MHC Toleransskola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Makedonska Helsingforskommitt&#xe9;ns Toleransskola &#xe4;mnar skapa b&#xe4;ttre kontakter mellan elever av olika etnisk bakgrund. De arbetar inte abra med eleverna, utan med hela n&#xe4;tverket omkring dem - elever, l&#xe4;rare, myndigheter samt familjerna. De kommer att arbeta i en rad skolor runt om i Makedonien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The School of Tolerance of the Macedonian Helsinki Committee ains at creating better contacts between students of different ethnic backgrounds. They do not only work with the students but with the entire surrounding network - students, teachers, authorities and families. They will work in a number of schools around Macedonia.</narrative>
  </description>
